 "description": "Living reconstruction of the Lujiatun fight, documentary-cartoon, no blood, no red in either mouth: adult Psittacosaurus lying on its belly facing right (tan-olive, darker back, pale belly, quilled tail, folded hind leg, tucked front arm), head low and forward at the right, drawn exactly as psittacosaurus.json (hooked dark beak, cheek horn, yellow eye ~(+244,-110)). A dark-brown Repenomamus lies along its back, its head well clear of the dinosaur head. Hold points (local, scale 1): jaws clamped on the ribs at mid-flank ~(+34,-64); front paw on the dinosaur lower jaw ~(+274,-46), below the eye; hind foot gripping the dinosaur thigh ~(-180,-74). ~610x195 (x -304..304, y -194..0), anchor bottom-centre (ground y=0).",
